{"id":40203,"date":"2025-01-31T06:52:47","date_gmt":"2025-01-31T05:52:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=40203"},"modified":"2026-08-24T09:58:00","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T08:58:00","slug":"trail-pinheiro-manso-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-pinheiro-manso-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Pinheiro Manso 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sob organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do clube<strong>&nbsp;GAC (Grupo de Atletismo da Caranguejeira),<\/strong>&nbsp;em parceria com a&nbsp;<strong>Junta de Freguesia da Caranguejeira<\/strong>, realiza-se a&nbsp;<strong>25 de Maio de 2025<\/strong>&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>VIII edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail do Pinheiro Manso (TPM).<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A prova \u00e9 constitu\u00edda por&nbsp;<strong>TPM K19 e TPM K11 e Caminhada:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li>TPM \u2013 K19 &#8211; Aproximadamente 19 km<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>TPM \u2013 K11 Aproximadamente 11 km<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Caminhada entre 8 km<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O TPM K19 prova integrante do Circuito de Trail Sprint da ADAL (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria). A provas percorrer\u00e3o percursos e trilhos na freguesia da Caranguejeira, no concelho de Leiria.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e chegada de ambas as provas e caminhada ser\u00e1 no Pavilh\u00e3o da Pedreira no Tubaral.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":40204,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497,498],"event_type_2":[38,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-40203","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-caranguejeira